{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_013FwvKKDdE8aaDEjCgb9fv7","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Supabase docs Row Level Security\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Securing your API\",\"url\":\"https://supabase.com/docs/guides/api/securing-your-api\"},{\"title\":\"Securing your data\",\"url\":\"https://supabase.com/docs/guides/database/secure-data\"},{\"title\":\"Database\",\"url\":\"https://supabase.com/docs/guides/database/overview\"},{\"title\":\"RAG with Permissions\",\"url\":\"https://supabase.com/docs/guides/ai/rag-with-permissions\"},{\"title\":\"Tables and data\",\"url\":\"https://supabase.com/docs/guides/database/tables\"},{\"title\":\"Auth\",\"url\":\"https://supabase.com/docs/guides/auth\"},{\"title\":\"API keys\",\"url\":\"https://supabase.com/docs/guides/getting-started/api-keys\"},{\"title\":\"Supabase Docs\",\"url\":\"https://supabase.com/docs/guides/troubleshooting/storage-error-403-forbidden-new-row-violates-row-level-security-policy-on-upload-a94384\"},{\"title\":\"Realtime Authorization\",\"url\":\"https://supabase.com/docs/guides/realtime/authorization\"},{\"title\":\"Production Checklist\",\"url\":\"https://supabase.com/docs/guides/deployment/going-into-prod\"}]\n\nThe search turned up several Supabase docs pages on Row Level Security (RLS), along with the core RLS guide.\n\n- **Securing your API** explains that grants and RLS are two separate layers. Grants decide which roles can reach an object, and RLS decides which rows those roles can see or change. The page recommends using both on every exposed object. [supabase.com/docs/guides/api/securing-your-api]\n- **Database and Access and security:** The Database overview lists RLS as a core topic, with sibling pages on RLS performance, column-level security, and Postgres roles. [supabase.com/docs/guides/database/overview]\n- **Tables and data** covers setup. Enabling RLS on a table with SQL is a manual step. Until a policy exists, Data API requests return no rows. [supabase.com/docs/guides/database/tables]\n- **API keys** describes how keys map to Postgres roles. Publishable keys resolve to `anon` or `authenticated`, and secret keys use `service_role`, which bypasses RLS. [supabase.com/docs/guides/getting-started/api-keys]\n- **Auth and Realtime:** The Auth docs describe using RLS with the user's JWT to scope row access. Realtime authorization uses RLS policies on the `realtime.messages` table to control private channels. [supabase.com/docs/guides/auth] [supabase.com/docs/guides/realtime/authorization]\n- **Production checklist** recommends confirming RLS is enabled on all tables before launch. [supabase.com/docs/guides/deployment/going-into-prod]\n\nThe main dedicated RLS page (`/docs/guides/database/postgres/row-level-security`) did not appear in these results. Its exact URL is inferred from the navigation links, so check it directly.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3613eada-d5bc-4446-bc4a-c0ae0afa9f6d","uuid":"4609e48b-3834-4b3f-a2ff-af033da5e44d","timestamp":"2026-10-17T01:01:52.490Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"Supabase docs Row Level Security","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01WmVT5VTSWXi81Q6ZbgMGhJ","content":[{"title":"Securing your API","url":"https://supabase.com/docs/guides/api/securing-your-api"},{"title":"Securing your data","url":"https://supabase.com/docs/guides/database/secure-data"},{"title":"Database","url":"https://supabase.com/docs/guides/database/overview"},{"title":"RAG with Permissions","url":"https://supabase.com/docs/guides/ai/rag-with-permissions"},{"title":"Tables and data","url":"https://supabase.com/docs/guides/database/tables"},{"title":"Auth","url":"https://supabase.com/docs/guides/auth"},{"title":"API keys","url":"https://supabase.com/docs/guides/getting-started/api-keys"},{"title":"Supabase Docs","url":"https://supabase.com/docs/guides/troubleshooti